<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS2" title="In Appendix A Final Corrected Sample SystemVerilog and Cocotb Test ‣ Architect in the Loop Agentic Hardware Design and Verification" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">A-B</span> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">test_RegisterFile.sv</span></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
